For each claim below, decide whether the cited chunk supports it.

A claim is supported if the chunk states it, or states something the claim
paraphrases accurately. A claim is NOT supported if the chunk is merely about
the same topic, or if the claim adds a number, date or severity the chunk does
not contain.

Return: {"claims": [{"index": <int>, "supported": <bool>, "reason": "<short>"}]}

